sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    participant W as Web App
    participant SC as SupportCategoriesController
    participant C as CasesController
    participant S as CaseService
    participant CS as IConsentService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Choose support type and category
    W->>SC: GET /api/SupportCategories/search?supportType&status=active
    W->>SC: GET /api/SupportCategories/{id}/shareable-attributes
    SC-->>W: Active attributes of the category's purpose
    STU->>W: Subject (academic), reason, attributes to share and a note per attribute
    W->>C: POST /api/Cases {supportCategoryId, subjectId, requestReason, sharedAttributes[{dataAttributeId, shareReason}]}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Check category active, subject only for academic, attributes covered by the active purpose
    S->>R: PrepareCreate Case (stage pending, priority medium, no advisor)
    S->>R: PrepareCreate CaseStageHistory (pending -> pending)
    opt shared attributes chosen
        S->>R: PrepareCreate CaseAttribute per shared attribute (shareReason, sharedAt)
        S->>CS: CreateAsync(StudentId, consents for the attributes)
        CS->>R: Stage consents and consent histories, SaveAsync() saves the staged case too
    end
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: INSERT CASES, CASESTAGEHISTORIES, CONSENTS, CONSENTHISTORIES
    S->>S: Log activity supportRequested
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(each Programme Head, "New support request")
    S-->>C: CreateCaseResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
